# shell: desktop
# apps: fixture
# AW-030/AW-040/AW-048: a document is opened by an APPLICATION.  Nothing in
# this port launched anything: a double click on a file did nothing at all,
# and "Open with" was a permanently grey menu item.
wait 8
note a double click opens the document in the application that claims its
note type, which really runs and is really handed the document
click-row 1
wait 2
click-row 1
wait 12
expect-status Stamper
expect-file-has /tmp/trk_launched /tmp/trk_script/a.txt
note and the pose menu offers the applications that can open what is
note selected, each saying why it is offered
click-row 1 3
wait 4
expect-menu Open with
note picking it opens a submenu of applications rather than choosing, and
note each row says why that application is in it
menu-pick Open with
wait 4
expect-menu Stamper
expect-menu opens this type
quit
